<title>UK: NatWest sets call warrants on Generali.</title>
<headline>NatWest sets call warrants on Generali.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatWest Markets said it has issued 100 million call warrants on ordinary shares of Generali SpA Assicuraioni.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    36,850 ITL		PREMIUM	21.7 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     391.0 ITL		 GEARING	8.4 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   29.JAN.99		 PAYDATE	29.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  33,500 ITL</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
